    {
      "id": "claim_f556c0b7a3264d14914803f0e60c4996",
      "statement": "After st.rerun with answered True, the answered branch renders the response text in a .response-text div and, only when audio_file is truthy and the file exists, builds an inline HTML block whose <img id='prof-gif'> defaults to the talking GIF and whose <audio autoplay controls> onplay swaps the image to the talking GIF and onended swaps it back to the idle GIF, with the MP3 base64-inlined as a data URI.",
