    {
      "id": "claim_bc48bf0d1f2d40caacb7c3424f250068",
      "statement": "The answered-branch avatar/audio render is wrapped in try/except Exception as e: st.warning('Não foi possível reproduzir o áudio: {e}'), so a render failure (missing file, base64 failure, component error) becomes a warning rather than crashing the page, while the response text still renders.",
