    {
      "id": "claim_9c1b4ebb3f634847a599607f41a820df",
      "statement": "The 'Tentar novamente' button resets the answered state: sets answered=False, clears response_text to '', and if audio_file is set os.removes the temp file (swallowing OSError), sets audio_file=None, and calls st.rerun(); this deletes the temp audio file so stale MP3s do not accumulate across retries.",
